{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0001","File":"web_letter-3-5版本前瞻-001.txt","Text":"不知你在星炬学院过得还好么？","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：3.5版本前瞻","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
