{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0003","File":"web_letter-3-5版本前瞻-003.txt","Text":"等你收到这封信的时候，我应该就要协助炽霞出任务嘞。","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：3.5版本前瞻","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0004","File":"web_letter-3-5版本前瞻-004.txt","Text":"最近今州有些不安宁，但不必担心，就像你已经用了那么多的故事去磨砺自己的剑一样，我想，自我们初见以来，我应该也有所成长。","Scene":"care","Emotion":"comforting","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：3.5版本前瞻","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0005","File":"web_letter-3-5版本前瞻-005.txt","Text":"等到下次，就由我来给你讲述我这次的“冒险”吧，漂泊者。","Scene":"relationship","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：3.5版本前瞻","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0006","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-001.txt","Text":"连绵多月的细雨终于停歇，天空澄澈，原野上的植物被雨水滋养，都生长得愈发蓬勃，翠色的草地，五彩的小花，还有可爱的鸟雀穿梭其中，总让我想起年幼时与姐姐一同放风筝的日子，","Scene":"memory","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅰ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0007","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-002.txt","Text":"那时的天气也如现在一般舒适。","Scene":"memory","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅰ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0008","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-003.txt","Text":"你那边的天气又是怎么样的呢？","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅰ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0009","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-004.txt","Text":"位于人造天幕之下的拉海洛，是否也和瑝珑一样，会有忽来的骤雨、雨后的彩虹，以及轻和的风？","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅰ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0010","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-005.txt","Text":"说起来，因为近期天气变化频繁，温差较大，不少人患上了轻微流感，漂泊者也请多注意身体，照顾好自己。","Scene":"care","Emotion":"comforting","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅰ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0011","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-006.txt","Text":"我有时候会想，我们所经历的事情，若在发生之时，有任何一点偏差，是否就会导致完全不一样的结果？","Scene":"relationship","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅱ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0012","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-007.txt","Text":"近来在梦中，我总能听到相同的声音。","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅱ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0013","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-008.txt","Text":"跟随着流息的指引，在梦的尽头，我总会看见另一个“我”。","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅱ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0014","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-009.txt","Text":"每一次，“我”都穿着未曾见过的服饰，被青色的鸟儿包围着，站在满目疮痍的世界中，被流息指引着往相同的命运走去。","Scene":"casual","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅱ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
{"Id":"yangyang-xuanling-0015","File":"web_letter-秧秧的信-010.txt","Text":"我不知道命运的终点是否有什么在等待，但我觉得，在这条命运的道路之上能与你相遇，我很幸运。","Scene":"relationship","Emotion":"neutral","SourceTitle":"秧秧来信：✦秧秧的信 Ⅱ✦","SourceUrl":"https://wiki.biligame.com/wutheringwaves/角色/秧秧#秧秧的信","SourceKind":"community_wiki_aggregated_official_letters","Variant":"xuanling","Confidence":"high"}
